ode/releases\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-12\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 2.1.139\",\n    \"description\": \"Added agent view (Research Preview), /goal command for completion conditions, /scroll-speed command, and claude plugin details. Added transcript view navigation shortcuts. Fixed deadlock with expired credentials and numerous other issues.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-11\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    \"title\": \"Improvements to Cursor Automations\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor Automations brought to the Agents Window with support for multi-repo automations, no-repo automations, and five new templates including Slack digest agent and product analytics agent. Cursor in Jira integration and Composer 2.5 with substantial intelligence improvements also introduced.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-21\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Aider\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 0.86.0 - GPT-5 and Grok-4 Support\",\n    \"description\": \"Added support for all GPT-5 models and Grok-4 via xai/grok-4 and openrouter/x-ai/grok-4 model names. Enhanced /clear and /undo commands, added support for gemini-2.5-flash-lite-preview-06-17 and openrouter/moonshotai/kimi-k2 models. Aider wrote 88% of the code in this release.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider/releases\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-17\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]"
